@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health — a API está no ar?
GET {{host}}/health

### Cadastro (register) — cria a conta e já devolve o token
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rafael",
  "email": "rafael@example.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### Login — autentica e devolve o token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rafael@example.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### Meu usuário — rota protegida (usa o token do login acima)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### (erro esperado: 401) /me sem token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### (erro esperado: 409) e-mail duplicado
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro",
  "email": "rafael@example.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### (erro esperado: 400) dados inválidos
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "nao-e-email",
  "password": "123"
}
